  "NROOT" [label="(0,0,0) This paper investigates the hypothesis that the low-ROS Ncf1 R90H variant promotes systemic lupus erythematosus or lupus-like autoimmune disease onset through a specific gene–environment synergy with murine norovirus infection, rather than through genetic susceptibility alone.", fillcolor="lightyellow", style="filled"];
